Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}In this four-node example, every size is one and capacity is two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}在这个四节点例子中，每个节点大小为一，容量为二。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.07,0:00:10.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Greedy takes the weight-ten A B edge, then the weight-one C D edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.07,0:00:10.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}贪心先选择权重十的 A、B 边，再选择权重一的 C、D 边。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.07,0:00:15.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The result reaches K legally, but its cross-cluster edges sum to eighteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.07,0:00:15.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}结果合法达到 K，但跨簇边的权重总和为十八。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.26,0:00:20.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Pairing node A with C, and node B with D, instead gives cutsize eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.26,0:00:20.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}如果改为 A 与 C、B 与 D 分别成簇，割边权重总和只有十一。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:26.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}This better legal partition proves that greedy does not guarantee global optimality.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:26.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}这个更好的合法分组说明：贪心算法不保证全局最优。
